        "content": "<p>Yes, if you identify simple lemmas that are missing in Mathlib, but should really be there, then we definitely accept PRs that add those lemmas.<br>\nMore information about the PR workflow can be found on the community website: <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/contribute/index.html\">https://leanprover-community.github.io/contribute/index.html</a></p>",
